# "{1}, {T}, Discard a card: Another target creature or planeswalker you control gains hexproof until end of turn." Turn 1 Liliana is
# summoning sick (the {T} cost, CR 302.6): refused with mana and a card to discard on hand. Turn 3 she pays {1} (Mox Pearl) and discards a Plains
# for her Ornithopter; she cannot target herself ("another"), nor Bot2's Ornithopter ("you control"). With hexproof Bot2's Bolt cannot target
# the Ornithopter (the refusal), yet the same Bolt can target Liliana (the control, and she dies). Turn 4 the hexproof is over and a second
# Bolt kills the Ornithopter. CR 702.11b, 611.2a.

